  "description": "Lee Jinwoo was a rising star in the world of swimming. During his first Olympic appearance, he mistook the sound of the horn for the starting signal and made a false start. Due to his usual arrogant demeanour, he faced excessive criticism at home and fled to a remote island. There, he met Tae-heon, a former teammate from his high school swimming club. Tae-heon greeted Jinwoo warmly, but the haughty Jin-woo was too busy scoffing at him... *(Source: RIDI, translated)*\n\nCharacter Profiles\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/4895003963)",
